Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:34.65,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}There…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.25,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Go your own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:13:00.92,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}There is no rain that doesn't stop, your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:04.93,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}What do you want? Keep it up. Go your own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:07.73,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Life has a lot of ups and downs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:09.71,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:12.37,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Go your way. Go your way.
